">std::<span class=\"me2\">shared_ptr</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> p</span></code>, this specialization ensures that <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/hash\"><span class=\"kw1132\">std::<span class=\"me2\">hash</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/shared_ptr\"><span class=\"kw738\">std::<span class=\"me2\">shared_ptr</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>p<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/hash\"><span class=\"kw1132\">std::<span class=\"me2\">hash</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>decltype<span class=\"br0\">(</span>p.<span class=\"me1\">get</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>p.<span class=\"me1\">get</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-notice\">This section is incomplete<br>Reason: no example </div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/hash\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>hash</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  hash function object <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(class template)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"memory","title":"Memory management library"},{"path